        "items": [
          {
            "ar": "اللَّهَ",
            "en": "Allah",
            "ref": "8:51",
            "verse": "ذَٰلِكَ بِمَا قَدَّمَتْ أَيْدِيكُمْ وَأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَيْسَ بِظَلَّـٰمٍۢ لِّلْعَبِيدِ",
            "verseEn": "That is for what your hands have put forth [of evil] and because Allāh is not ever unjust to [His] servants.\""
          },
          {
            "ar": "الْغَفُورُ",
            "en": "(is) the Oft-Forgiving",
            "ref": "46:8",
            "verse": "أَمْ يَقُولُونَ ٱفْتَرَىٰهُ ۖ قُلْ إِنِ ٱفْتَرَيْتُهُۥ فَلَا تَمْلِكُونَ لِى مِنَ ٱللَّهِ شَيْـًٔا ۖ هُوَ أَعْلَمُ بِمَا تُفِيضُونَ فِيهِ ۖ كَفَىٰ بِهِۦ شَهِيدًۢا بَيْنِى وَبَيْنَكُمْ ۖ وَهُوَ ٱلْغَفُورُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ",
            "verseEn": "Or do they say, \"He has invented it\"? Say, \"If I have invented it, you will not possess for me [the power of protection] from Allāh at all. He is most knowing of that in which you are involved. Sufficient is He as Witness between me and you, and He is the Forgiving, the Merciful.\""
          },
          {
            "ar": "رَبِّ",
            "en": "Lord",
            "ref": "69:43",
            "verse": "تَنزِيلٌۭ مِّن رَّبِّ ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ",
            "verseEn": "[It is] a revelation from the Lord of the worlds."
          },
          {
            "ar": "الْعَزِيزُ",
            "en": "(is) the All-Mighty",
            "ref": "26:122",
            "verse": "وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَهُوَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ",
            "verseEn": "And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "أَلْفَاظُ الْعَذَابِ",
        "nameEn": "Words denoting divine punishment",
        "color": "green",
        "items": [
          {
            "ar": "وَيْلٌ",
            "en": "Woe",
            "ref": "77:40",
            "verse": "وَيْلٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ لِّلْمُكَذِّبِينَ",
            "verseEn": "Woe, that Day, to the deniers."
          },
          {
            "ar": "بِعَذَابٍ",
            "en": "of a punishment",
            "ref": "84:24",
            "verse": "فَبَشِّرْهُم بِعَذَابٍ أَلِيمٍ",
            "verseEn": "So give them tidings of a painful punishment,"
          },
          {
            "ar": "جَهَنَّمَ",
            "en": "(of) Hell",
            "ref": "40:49",
            "verse": "وَقَالَ ٱلَّذِينَ فِى ٱلنَّارِ لِخَزَنَةِ جَهَنَّمَ ٱدْعُوا۟ رَبَّكُمْ يُخَفِّفْ عَنَّا يَوْمًۭا مِّنَ ٱلْعَذَابِ",
            "verseEn": "And those in the Fire will say to the keepers of Hell, \"Supplicate your Lord to lighten for us a day from the punishment.\""
          },
          {
            "ar": "الْعِقَابِ",
            "en": "(in) the penalty",
            "ref": "8:52",
            "verse": "كَدَأْبِ ءَالِ فِرْعَوْنَ ۙ وَٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِهِمْ ۚ كَفَرُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِ ٱللَّهِ فَأَخَذَهُمُ ٱللَّهُ بِذُنُوبِهِمْ ۗ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ قَوِىٌّۭ شَدِيدُ ٱلْعِقَابِ",
            "verseEn": "[Theirs is] like the custom of the people of Pharaoh and of those before them. They disbelieved in the signs of Allāh, so Allāh seized them for their sins. Indeed, Allāh is Powerful and severe in penalty."
          }
        ]
      },
